{"sha": "68b2658591b385c581ddf1a569ad9b1356adf1cc6720f34ae2f8922c68c66242", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:comparison:12}", "$(u_n)$ 单调递增；若它有界，则会收敛于某个", "有限的 $\\ell$，且 $\\ell = \\ell + \\eu^{-\\ell}$，这不可能。故", "$u_n \\to \\infty$。令 $v_n = \\eu^{u_n} \\to \\infty$，则", "\\[", "v_{n+1} = \\eu^{u_n + \\eu^{-u_n}} = v_n\\,\\eu^{1/v_n}", "= v_n\\Bigl(1 + \\frac1{v_n} + \\frac1{2v_n^2} +", "O\\bigl(v_n^{-3}\\bigr)\\Bigr)", "= v_n + 1 + \\frac{1}{2v_n} + O\\bigl(v_n^{-2}\\bigr).", "\\]", "先对 $v_{k+1} - v_k = 1 + O(1)$ 求和，得 $v_n = n +", "O(n)$，因此最终有 $v_n \\geq cn$；重新求和时用", "$\\frac1{2v_k} = O(\\frac1k)$，得 $v_n = n + O(\\ln n)$。", "再作一轮：$\\frac{1}{2v_k} = \\frac{1}{2k}\\bigl(1 +", "O\\bigl(\\tfrac{\\ln k}k\\bigr)\\bigr)$，于是", "\\[", "v_n = n + \\sum_{k<n}\\frac1{2k} + O(1) = n + \\frac{\\ln n}2 +", "O(1).", "\\]", "最后，$u_n = \\ln v_n = \\ln n + \\ln\\Bigl(1 + \\frac{\\ln n}{2n} +", "O\\bigl(\\tfrac1n\\bigr)\\Bigr) = \\ln n + \\frac{\\ln n}{2n} +", "O\\bigl(\\tfrac1n\\bigr)$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:comparison:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 两式相减，得 $\\sum_i (c_i -", "c_i')\\varphi_i = o(\\varphi_k)$。若某个系数不同，设", "$i_0$ 为第一个这样的下标：除以 $\\varphi_{i_0}$，", "利用 $\\varphi_j = o(\\varphi_{i_0})$（$j > i_0$）得 $c_{i_0} -", "c_{i_0}' = o(1)$，故为零，矛盾。关于展开式：", "令 $u = \\frac{\\ln x}x \\to 0$，", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{x - \\ln x} = \\frac1x\\cdot\\frac{1}{1 - u}", "= \\frac1x\\bigl(1 + u + u^2 + O(u^3)\\bigr)", "= \\frac1x + \\frac{\\ln x}{x^2} + \\frac{(\\ln x)^2}{x^3} +", "o\\Bigl(\\frac{(\\ln x)^2}{x^3}\\Bigr).", "\\]", "展开式中不出现 $\\frac c{x^2}$ 项，因为该展开是", "关于 $u = \\frac{\\ln x}{x}$ 的几何级数：每一项中 $\\ln x$ 的幂次，", "与 $\\frac1x$ 除首个因子外的幂次相同；", "比较尺度上的 $\\frac1{x^2}$ 一级（即 $(\\ln x)^0$ 的系数）", "恰好缺失，其系数为 $0$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} $f(x) = \\eu^x + x$ 连续、严格", "递增，极限为 $-\\infty$ 与 $+\\infty$，故为", "$\\R \\to \\R$ 的双射，因此 $x_n = f^{-1}(n)$ 存在且唯一，并且", "$x_n \\to +\\infty$（$f^{-1}$ 递增至 $+\\infty$）。由", "$\\eu^{x_n} = n - x_n$ 得 $x_n = \\ln(n - x_n) \\leq \\ln n$，故", "$x_n/n \\to 0$，且 $x_n = \\ln n + \\ln(1 - x_n/n) = \\ln n + o(1)", "\\sim \\ln n$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} 记 $u_n = x_n/n$。第二轮：$u_n = \\frac{\\ln n", "+ o(1)}{n}$，于是", "\\[", "x_n = \\ln n + \\ln(1 - u_n) = \\ln n - u_n + O(u_n^2)", "= \\ln n - \\frac{\\ln n}{n} + o\\Bigl(\\frac{\\ln n}n\\Bigr).", "\\]", "第三轮：此时 $u_n = \\frac{\\ln n}{n} - \\frac{\\ln n}{n^2} +", "o\\bigl(\\frac{\\ln n}{n^2}\\bigr)$，且 $\\ln(1 - u_n) = -u_n -", "\\frac{u_n^2}2 + O(u_n^3)$：", "\\[", "x_n = \\ln n - \\frac{\\ln n}n + \\frac{\\ln n}{n^2}", "- \\frac{(\\ln n)^2}{2n^2} + o\\Bigl(\\frac{(\\ln", "n)^2}{n^2}\\Bigr)", "= \\ln n - \\frac{\\ln n}{n} - \\frac{(\\ln n)^2}{2n^2} +", "o\\Bigl(\\frac{(\\ln n)^2}{n^2}\\Bigr),", "\\]", "其中项 $\\frac{\\ln n}{n^2}$ 被吸收进", "$o\\bigl(\\frac{(\\ln n)^2}{n^2}\\bigr)$ 之中。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 当 $n = 1000$ 时：$\\ln 1000 \\approx 6.90776$（误差", "$7\\cdot10^{-3}$）；取两项：$6.90085$（误差", "$2\\cdot10^{-5}$）；取三项：$6.90082$（误差小于", "$10^{-5}$），而 $x_{1000} \\approx 6.90083$。每一轮", "误差大致按预测的因子 $\\frac{\\ln n}{n}$ 缩小。", "", "\\textbf{5.} 从右端开始，连续两次分部积分：", "由 $\\frac{\\dd}{\\dd t}\\bigl[\\tfrac12t(1-t)\\bigr] = \\tfrac12 -", "t$，且 $t(1-t)$ 在两端点处为零，", "\\[", "\\frac12\\int_0^1 t(1-t)g''(t)\\dd t", "= -\\int_0^1\\Bigl(\\frac12 - t\\Bigr)g'(t)\\dd t", "= -\\Bigl[\\Bigl(\\frac12 - t\\Bigr)g\\Bigr]_0^1 - \\int_0^1 g", "= \\frac{g(0) + g(1)}2 - \\int_0^1 g .", "\\]", "移项即得所述恒等式。", "", "\\textbf{6.} 先计算增量，再将第 5 题应用于", "$g(t) = f(n + t)$：", "\\begin{align*}", "E_{n+1} - E_n", "&= f(n{+}1) - \\int_n^{n+1}\\!f - \\frac{f(n{+}1) - f(n)}2 \\\\", "&= \\frac{f(n) + f(n{+}1)}2 - \\int_n^{n+1}\\!f", "= \\frac12\\int_0^1 t(1-t)f''(n+t)\\dd t .", "\\end{align*}", "由于 $0 \\leq t(1-t) \\leq \\frac14$，有 $\\abs{E_{n+1} - E_n} \\leq", "\\frac18\\int_n^{n+1}\\abs{f''}$，其关于 $n$ 的和由假设收敛，", "因此 $(E_n)$ 收敛（增量绝对可和）", "到某个 $E$，并且", "\\[", "\\abs{E - E_n} \\leq \\sum_{k\\geq n}\\abs{E_{k+1} - E_k} \\leq", "\\frac18\\int_n^\\infty\\abs{f''} .", "\\]", "", "\\textbf{7.} 取 $f(t) = \\frac1t$，则 $f''(t) = \\frac2{t^3}$，", "$\\int_1^\\infty\\abs{f''} = 1 < \\infty$。由第 6 题得", "\\[", "H_n = \\ln n + \\frac{1 + \\frac1n}{2} + E + (E_n - E)", "= \\ln n + \\Bigl(E + \\frac12\\Bigr) + \\frac1{2n} +", "\\varepsilon_n,", "\\]", "其中 $\\abs{\\varepsilon_n} = \\abs{E_n - E} \\leq", "\\frac18\\int_n^\\infty\\frac{2\\dd t}{t^3} = \\frac1{8n^2}$。", "与 $H_n = \\ln n + \\gamma + o(1)$ 比较，", "（见\\cref{ex:b2:comparison:harmonic}）可定出 $E + \\frac12 =", "\\gamma$。", ""]}